WEBVTT

NOTE
Kinro customer story, Pierre-Alexandre Kamienny (48.2 s). English captions.
The first 3.2 s are the intro: no speech.

1
00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:04.941
I’m Pierre, I’m the CEO of Kinro.

2
00:00:05.022 --> 00:00:06.242
We are the first autonomous

3
