4
00:00:07.962 --> 00:00:09.903
is to be the best one in the US.

5
00:00:09.903 --> 00:00:11.403
We’ve doubled our customer base

6
00:00:11.403 --> 00:00:12.864
every two months since we started

7
00:00:12.864 --> 00:00:14.804
and we just came out of Y Combinator.

8
